WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:50.480
THE HADLAR ROYAL GUARD

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.860
That was pretty rough.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:01.660
Hey, you're the first honorable member
of the Beast King Commandos!

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.700
You're a Terrordactyl...

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:06.660
But that's too long,
so I'll call you "Terry!"

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:10.040
Yup, yup.

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:11.170
Hm?

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:16.170
Uh...

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.720
You look like you want to join.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.270
Then you'll have to
idolize me as your leader!

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:26.850
Got it?

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:31.190
Is that a fire?

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:36.230
No, our objective is to the north!

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.120
My name is Nova.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.290
They call me the Hero of the North.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.750
What?!

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.710
The Hero of the North?

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.430
I'll go rescue Zababa with my Zoom spell.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:06.810
I don't need the help of
a bunch of amateurs.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:11.060
What?! Do you know who we are?!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:15.400
The self-proclaimed "Heroes"
from Papnica, right?

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.070
W-Why you...!

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.740
That's enough, Nova!

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.950
What is it, Dad?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.410
Dad?!

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.330
Please excuse him.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:34.210
Nova is my son,
and Captain of the Knights of Ringaia.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.840
Nova, you disrespect the Hero
and his friends!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.970
What's wrong with stating the truth?

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.720
Besides, I can't stand everybody
calling themselves Heroes.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:51.560
There's only one true Hero
that the world needs to respect!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:57.150
You bastard! That's our line!

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.280
Wait, Popp!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.030
Don't stop me, Dai!

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:04.110
This isn't the time for that!

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.710
Will you take us to Zababa with you?

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.620
It's better if we all fight together!

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.880
I see. You must be Dai.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.090
Yeah.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.470
Huh?!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.730
That's... an Aura Shot!

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.780
And he's pretty adept at it!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:47.950
No thanks. I'll be going alone.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.370
I'd heard the rumors...

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:56.000
but knowing I was being compared
to a shrimp like you irritates me.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.920
I'll protect everyone.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:00.880
Zoom!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.010
Wait, Nova!

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:05.130
Get back here!

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.640
That snotty little...!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.600
What a hopelessly selfish Hero.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.600
Please forgive me.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.650
I tried to raise him strictly,

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.860
but recently, he won't even listen to me.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.280
Talk about overconfident!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:30.780
Our Ringaia Army was dispatched to Orzam
to help them from being wiped out.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:36.040
During that time, the Dark Army
destroyed our homeland.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:42.710
He still believes he could have
saved Ringaia had he been here.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:47.180
Baran was the one who destroyed Ringaia.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.100
Even if that boy had been there...

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.970
Guys like that don't learn
until they get hurt!

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.730
But it's too dangerous
for him to go alone!

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.360
He already went off alone!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:06.490
It's true he's arrogant
and quite self-centered...

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:10.200
but rescuing the port is more important!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.990
Let's go! Leona's right!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.450
Didn't he make you mad?

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:20.000
Who cares who's a Hero and who's not?

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:20.790
Huh?!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:24.300
It's better to have more strong allies.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:29.590
It doesn't matter if there happen to be
two, three, or even a hundred Heroes!

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.310
It looks like Dai wins this argument!

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:40.900
Honestly, the way your mind works
never ceases to amaze with its simplicity!

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:42.860
Let's go!

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:43.900
Okay!

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.400
Dai and I will go ahead
using Levizoom spells!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:51.200
Everybody follow after!

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:52.490
Got it!

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:53.830
Wait, Popp!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.460
I have clothes for you
made from the same material as Dai's.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:02.170
Thanks, but we're in a hurry, Princess.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.170
Plus, am I supposed to strip here?

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:09.010
It's a type of outerwear,
so just wear it over your clothes!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:10.260
Huh.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:11.930
Dai.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.390
I'm sorry. Please look after my son.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.560
Okay!

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.090
Oh? Another punching bag to play with?

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.970
When will the real Hero
and his friends come?

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:58.180
I guess you need your eyes checked!

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.350
What?

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.810
The real one is right here.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:03.650
The real one?

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:05.860
Sir Nova!

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.230
Please run!

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:12.070
Th-That's right! Wait until Dai gets here!

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.780
Your friend's right.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:22.620
If you're going to fight, shouldn't you
wait until Dai, the Hero arrives?

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:23.830
Well?

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.210
This stuff is amazing!

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.880
It's so thin yet still
as tough as Dai's clothes!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.590
Hey! Wait up!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:41.770
I just learned how to use Levizoom
without my crest!

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.310
If you insist.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.320
Oh well.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:53.990
Recently, your power's been increasing
like you're some kind of beast.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.070
It feels nice to still be
better than you at something.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.580
Beast is a bit much.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.500
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:13.260
I, Nova, am the true Hero! Not Dai!

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:16.470
All everybody talks about is Dai...

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.050
What's so great about him?!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.970
Stay back, everybody.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.270
Overconfident fools like him...

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:29.110
need a little lesson from me.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:51.880
I guess you haven't heard
that we're made of Orichalcum.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.670
I see.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:59.800
Unfortunately, breaking my sword
doesn't hinder my killer attack at all!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:00.760
What?!

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.560
That's...

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.610
Hmm.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.650
Aura Blade!

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:22.740
No matter how tough Orichalcum is,
it will break against a greater force!

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:29.210
My sword of Aura is much sharper
than even a legendary weapon!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.130
There they are!

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.960
Nova's still alright!

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.630
They're finally here.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:38.970
Nova!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.220
Shut up and back off!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.220
But...!

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:43.680
His Aura is amazing!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.100
He just might...

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.520
I said to stay back.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.400
Come on.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:53.190
Die, you piece of scrap!

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.160
Northern...

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:04.910
Grand...

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.660
Blade!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.430
Hey! He actually did it!

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:27.850
No...

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.650
That actually hurt!

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:41.280
I guess for a human, this would be like
banging your head on a corner!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:58.880
Not bad.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.300
For a preliminary fight...

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.720
that was fun.

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.440
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.440
ULTRA COMBUSTION SLASH

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.700
No...

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.620
Impossible! He's not hurt?!

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:33.540
<i>That should have damaged him,
no matter how tough he is!</i>

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.000
It's very simple.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.630
Even when you humans
focus with your frail bodies,

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.930
you can increase your defensive power.

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.550
I merely did the same thing.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.720
I already knew you would aim for my head.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:55.690
If I just focus all my power here,
I can withstand an attack like that.

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.650
<i>They're strong!</i>

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.030
<i>They're unlike any enemy
we've faced before!</i>

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.280
<i>One thing is clear.</i>

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.860
<i>They're not strong only because
they're made of Orichalcum!</i>

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.780
<i>They're true pieces of battle!</i>

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:14.750
<i>They're born to fight. All they know
is combat... They're weapons of war.</i>

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:18.710
<i>They're all born geniuses of battle!</i>

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.340
Damn it!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.500
Wait, Nova!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:22.880
Don't touch me!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.430
I'm stronger than this!

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:26.470
My next attack...!

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:27.800
Knock it off!

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:31.600
You're strong enough to know
how dangerous they are!

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:35.020
He's right.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.600
Work with us!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.310
No!

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.310
What?!

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.650
As the Hero of the North...

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.610
I shall defeat them with my own power!

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.450
Look around you!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.370
They all need help!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:14:00.540
Isn't protecting friends
what a Hero is supposed to do?!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.090
Defeating the enemy
will protect them sooner!

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:05.470
That's not being a Hero!

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:06.510
Shut up!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.510
Nova!

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.140
I won't...

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:16.350
I won't let you lecture me
about being a Hero!

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.070
Needle...

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.570
Thousand.

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:35.450
Nova!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.630
Needle Thousand.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.300
You used it on an enemy that weak?

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:49.220
It would be an insult
to have our guest of honor wait.

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:53.550
Allow me a belated introduction.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:58.430
We are Dark Commander Hadlar's
loyal servants.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.390
The Hadlar Royal Guard.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:05.860
I am the queen and leader, Albinass.

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:10.780
I'm the pawn, Hym.
You remember me, don't you?

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.990
I am the knight who races across
the battlefield, Sigma.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.870
Remember me.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.580
My name is Fenbren.

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:25.420
I am the Bishop of the Royal Guard,
and the perfect hunter.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:29.510
What's that?!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:33.390
And there's one more.

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.100
The ship...

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.060
is on land?!

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.610
He is the rook, Block.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:57.370
He does not speak,
so I shall introduce him.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:01.660
Block, that ship is important to them!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.120
Give it back!

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:04.330
You mean...?!

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.420
Everybody run!

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:26.860
The cannons' gunpowder must have ignited.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:31.740
Darn it!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.740
Dai, this could actually be our chance!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:39.120
While this smoke is hiding us,

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:42.460
I'll use my Extreme Spell to finish this!

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:43.960
Extreme Spell?!

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.170
Yeah!

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.340
An ambush for an ambush!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.630
Before they can reveal their power,

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:54.930
I'll annihilate them all with my Medroa!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.180
Popp, what is that?!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:04.890
I'm going to fabricate Magic Power that'll
annihilate our enemies in an instant!

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:08.060
This thing packs a punch!

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.320
Sweet! My clothes don't burn!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.580
An arrow of light?! That's amazing!

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:24.790
I'll explain it later!
After I blow them away!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.880
They're not coming out. Are they dead?

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:32.550
Unlikely. That was hardly
enough to kill them.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.840
I guess I'll drag them out.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:42.180
Sorry. I still haven't memorized
your names and faces.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:45.060
I'll end it with this!

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:46.730
Take this!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:47.810
Not yet!

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:49.190
Nova?!

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:52.820
Not yet! I haven't been beaten yet!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:55.440
Don't! Normal spells won't work on them!

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:59.200
Magic may not work,
but they should be momentarily frozen!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:01.200
If I attack in that moment...!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.410
Kacrackle!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.880
Now!

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:26.100
Popp!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.240
That was an impressive spell.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.320
Darn it!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:43.830
Oh no! One of them can reflect spells!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:45.620
Indeed.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:51.960
This Mirror of Shahal is the ultimate item
that can reflect any spell that hits it.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:54.630
And at the same time...

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.800
it is the ultimate shield.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.220
This is bad!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.840
<i>Listen up, Popp.</i>

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:06.470
There's one thing I have to warn you
about using Medroa.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:09.140
Watch out for counters.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.230
Counters?

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:16.190
The spell Bounce can reflect a spell
back at its caster.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:21.110
There are also legendary weapons
that have the same ability.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:24.160
If the enemy has one, it's game over.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.330
You'll be the ones wiped out.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:30.080
It's why I was too scared to use it
back in the day.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:33.500
I'm fine dying from my own mistake,

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.670
but I couldn't stand it
if it took out my friends too.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:44.430
I get it. Being too powerful
is this spell's greatest weakness.

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:49.810
Now I can't use Medroa against them...

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.770
But it's a silver lining.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:55.900
If Nova hadn't interrupted me,
we'd be annihilated.

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:57.690
Wait! Where's Nova?!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:05.780
Nova!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.700
When did you grab him?!

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.040
Darn it!

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:12.290
Dai...

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:20.010
It looks like...
you were right... after all.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:28.470
I guess I'm not...
a real... Hero.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:35.100
No Hero would be... this pathetic.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:37.060
Damn it...

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.400
Damn it!

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.320
Nova!

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:46.410
I guess this was a good lesson.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.080
Your whole body is frozen.

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:53.290
One punch and I can shatter you...

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.670
like powdered snow.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:56.630
Don't!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.500
You cruel bastard!

00:20:58.670 --> 00:20:59.880
You're wrong!

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.510
I know how he feels all too well!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.550
There are those of us

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:11.350
who would rather die beautifully,
than to live in disgrace.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:12.140
Right?

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.600
Darn it!

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:16.980
Here's a lesson to take with you.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:20.730
In this world,
there's always someone stronger.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.900
Well... goodbye!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.200
Nova!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:30.240
At least die gloriously, you loser!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.490
No!

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:45.090
You talk too much.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:47.720
But you were right about one thing.

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:50.720
There's always someone stronger!

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:56.140
Hyunckel!

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:07.240
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:07.240
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.200
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.200
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:15.290
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:15.290
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:19.330
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:19.330
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:22.630
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:22.630
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:26.550
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:26.550
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:30.260
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:30.260
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:34.560
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:34.560
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:38.600
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:38.600
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:42.400
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:42.400
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:47.990
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:47.990
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:53.580
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:53.580
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.540 --> 00:22:59.670
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.540 --> 00:22:59.670
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:03.840
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:03.840
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.340
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.340
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.510
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.510
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.180
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.180
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:22.400
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:22.400
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:36.040
<i>Nova could do nothing against Hym.</i>

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:39.580
<i>Maam, Hyunckel, and Crocodine
arrive just in time.</i>

00:23:39.750 --> 00:23:44.290
<i>The Orichalcum warriors' solidarity,
born from their loyalty to Hadlar,</i>

00:23:44.460 --> 00:23:47.630
<i>or Dai and his friends' teamwork,
honed by countless battles.</i>

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:50.260
<i>Which will come out on top?</i>

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:53.140
<i>The fierce battle begins!</i>

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:55.720
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.890 --> 00:23:57.640
<i>"The Team Battle Begins"</i>

00:23:57.810 --> 00:23:59.730
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
